      "cml:conclusionText": "electoral roll means: (a) a Roll of the electors of: (i) a State or Territory; or (ii) a Division (within the meaning of the Electoral Act); or (iii) a Subdivision (within the meaning of the Electoral Act); prepared under the Electoral Act;",
