      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The agency must recognize the importance of personal privacy in its decision-making.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recognizes",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) In determining whether the disclosure of the document would involve the unreasonable disclosure of personal information, an agency or Minister must have regard to..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-act-1982-sch-4-sec-47f-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the person to whom the information relates is known to be (or to have been) associated with the matters dealt with in the document;",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency has an obligation to consider personal information.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) In determining whether the disclosure of the document would involve the unreasonable disclosure of personal information, an agency or Minister must have regard to..."
    },
    {
